The size is 3.
The pairs is 1.
The rows is size plus 1.
The columns is pairs plus 1.
The total is rows times columns.
The table is a list of total zeros.
Set item 0 of table to 1.
For every length from 1 to size.
For every inversions from 0 to pairs.
The cell is length times columns plus inversions.
The reach is inversions.
If length minus 1 is less than reach, set reach to length minus 1.
The base is (length minus 1) times columns.
For every used from 0 to reach.
The source is base plus inversions minus used.
Set item cell of table to (item cell of table plus item source of table) modulo 1000000007.

The answer is item (size times columns plus pairs) of table.
Show answer.
